      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Upon further testing, the issue seems to go a lot more deeper than I expected. Will link a video here shortly.\n\nMore specifics, earmuff settings were set to:\n\nDistance: 0m\n\nOutside Volume: 0%\n\nFalloff Distance: 3m\n\nCone: 100%\n\nForward Shift 100%\n\nIt seemed at first like falloff distance has a bit of influence there as I didn't recall having issues on other values except when precisely at 3m for falloff, but after further testing, falloff distance probably doesn't have anything to do with it. See further down.\n\nVideo: https://files.catbox.moe/rmh4xq.mp4\n\nIt seems when turning off the aid, it decouples the earmuff zone from you, keeping it in its last position until you turn the aid back on again (or turn off and on earmuff mode again.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
